<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>The Weekend - Radio Edit</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Michael Gray</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Analog Is On</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6KzkqZqhUBEsWYJJa2aBOd</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:08.000">I can't wait  for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.050" end="00:16.920" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.920" end="00:21.300">I'm workin', all week long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.300" end="00:22.800" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.630" end="00:24.480">I dream the days away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.480" end="00:28.170">I wanna  sing my song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.170" end="00:29.670" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.190" end="00:31.170">So let the music play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.170" end="00:33.000">I have to get my kicks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.000" end="00:34.920">And fly  tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.920" end="00:36.690">And when the clock strikes six</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.690" end="00:38.190" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.840" end="00:39.360">On Friday night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.360" end="00:43.290">I need to blow it all away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.290" end="00:44.790" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.770" end="00:45.900" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Blow, blow, blow, blow, blow)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.900" end="00:50.850">I can't wait  for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.850" end="00:53.370" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.370" end="01:01.370">I can't wait  for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.280" end="01:05.550">I make it  what  I can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.550" end="01:07.050" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.050" end="01:09.840">I try, I try</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.840" end="01:13.530">I'm shakin' up  my plan</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.530" end="01:15.030" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.580" end="01:16.500">And I  get by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.500" end="01:18.390">I'm saving all my soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.390" end="01:20.190">And all  my pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.190" end="01:21.810">So I can lose control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.810" end="01:23.310" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.170" end="01:24.750">On Saturday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.750" end="01:29.580">I'm gonna blow it all away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.580" end="01:31.260" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Blow, blow, blow, blow, blow)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.260" end="01:36.180">I can't wait  for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.180" end="01:38.730" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.730" end="01:43.740">I can't wait  for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.740" end="01:51.740" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.410" end="02:07.260">I can't wait for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.260" end="02:09.780">For the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.780" end="02:17.780">...begin, begin, begin, begin, begin, begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.850" end="02:24.120" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Begin begin begin begin begin begin begin)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.120" end="02:32.040">I can't wait  for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.040" end="02:33.960">I got to get my fix,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.960" end="02:35.850">And fly  tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.850" end="02:37.740">And when the clock strikes six</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.740" end="02:40.320">On Friday night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.320" end="02:45.180">I'm gonna blow it all away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.180" end="02:46.830" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Blow, blow, blow, blow, blow)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.830" end="02:51.780">I can't wait  for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.780" end="02:53.340" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.340" end="02:54.840">I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.360" end="02:59.340">I can't wait  for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.340" end="03:01.200" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.200" end="03:02.700">I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.890" end="03:06.600">I can't wait  for the weekend to begin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.600" end="03:10.600" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I... I... I... I... I...)</p></div></body></tt>